OL,3,GNEWSADrug trafficker jailed after bank
OL,4,Aprobe revealed #700,000 fortune
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drug trafficker who was caught after
OL,7,Fhis bank raised concerns about the
OL,8,Famount of money going through his
OL,9,Faccount has been jailed for four years.
OL,11,FRoss Black, 33, was unemployed and had
OL,12,Fnot paid tax or national insurance
OL,13,Fsince February 2021, but was found with
OL,14,F#709,623 in cash, bank, and saving
OL,15,Faccounts.
OL,17,FThe former welder, formerly of Dalgety
OL,18,FBay in Fife, admitted to being involved
OL,19,Fin the supply of cocaine between
OL,20,FOctober 2022 and October 2023.
